    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 3rd level.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> A creature with this feat can command two crews at once rather than just one. Both crews must still be able to see or hear this creature to gain the benefits of having him as their commanding officer.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/skybourne-feats#toc10\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
